SUMMARY:Email census rolling run: batches 119-123 processed\, 6\,150 
 messages (429 wall broken)
UID:d05a84ba-9a7f-41df-b164-e17e7c222d22@d05a.org
DESCRIPTION:Rolling census run for the main mailbox via the direct\nread-
 only Gmail API route. After seven consecutive runs\nstopped by a 429 on 
 the batch-119 list call\, this run\nstarted about 5h41m after the last 
 retry-after and\nprocessed batches 119-123 in full: 250 messages\, 228 
 of\nthem unread and body-read\, hand-classified\, no 429\nanywhere. 
 Running total 6\,150 of 96\,744. Attention list\ngrew to 699 entries: the 
 payment-failure window now\nopens Jul 17 (PayPal decline and a Bank of 
 America\ninsufficient-funds alert for the business account)\,\nWorkspace 
 payment failures on both domains on Jul 20\,\na Google account-recovery 
 security alert and an Accor\nsecurity-incident notice on Jul 17. 
 Checkpoint paused\nfor resume from batch 124\; no retry-after outstanding.
DTSTAMP:20261014T222559Z
END:VEVENT
